    ],
    "features": [
      "aster-engine/pgo-driver"
    ],
    "control": "Rebuild matched control with same target, flags and release profile before any candidate queries. Pin its binary in build report; compare PGO with this control.",
    "profile": "Fresh unique staging directory; generate instrumentation, collect fixed workloads with per-process/module raw filenames, merge with matching Rust llvm-profdata, use merged profile. Preserve all data/warnings. No parameter variants or adaptive retraining.",
    "training_driver": "Development-only Rust binary aster-pgo-trainer links the same core and returns normally. Only this driver collects core bench/UCI profiles; actual matched engine is standalone aster. Same pgo-driver feature for control, instrumented and optimized builds; no playing algorithm changes."
